<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Dankos Laboratories H1 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dankos Laboratories H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales			    76.79    vs   63.96</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 40.99    vs   36.48</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   13.65    vs   13.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     17.28    vs   15.66</p>
<p>    Net profit			   12.09    vs   11.25</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    95    vs	88</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were unaudited. Dankos Laboratories is a pharmaceutical company. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
